{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as <strong>Camellia</strong>, a <strong>nonconventional princess</strong>, heiress to the throne, who has to fulfill multitude obligations, due to her rank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Camelia evolves in <strong>two dimensions</strong>: <br>the world of her <strong>Palace</strong>, and the <strong>ethereal world</strong> where she practices <strong>\u201cDerivation\u201d</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cDerivation\u201d is a kind\u00a0of meditation</strong>,\u00a0which helps her solve problems when\u00a0she returns to the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The meditation is\u00a0a <strong>side scrolling\u00a0action game</strong>,\u00a0where <strong>levels</strong>, <strong>weapons</strong> and <strong>enemies</strong> are <strong>procedurally generated</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/AGV_vUdDR0nWJ2WsWAT49PjsweBB-_sidxQCqDps9Ob3NW8zx3dWPc9Sn_ObVqPaELajL_jKuP2Ehbke1wn_PphpX4GoSCYymk2kTiVO8NbafiClpBWzCAEXc2ND9R9eTCQN5knV9NBY9Q=s2048.gif?t=1740688426\" />\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/camelia_hits_zombie.gif?t=1740688426\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An innovative concept where you battle monsters in your <strong>Derivation</strong> to deepen your relationships and overcome obstacles in real life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Run</strong>, <strong>Jump</strong>, <strong>Punch</strong>, <strong>Divekick</strong>, <strong>Super.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/AGV_vUeZaecbTPaYSUtdwmobn1PmI8afpE-W2NVmkpnTmRw7fUJW9FsLGTbl2WQFdSZZZyXmQM1qlrfOsQKaA2G8flE_dvO-zpnt7JvCkVwe6TWyUX7DEgqDwC8q5gHyTAXNM_DdOK_NEg=s2048.gif?t=1740688426\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pickup new <strong>procedurally generated weapons</strong> every run.\u00a0Beware, if you get hit, you lose your weapon, it may never reappear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/image.png?t=1740688426\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combo System</strong>:\u00a0Chain actions and take risks to reap more rewards. <br>  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/AGV_vUdnlke2lj8sSdDeyQq5qliPTR505DV0lpJksBRm_PrM5NcjtloJSbOUYmctjxEPna4KsOeivHE_NMEVcY1Bkg2_BUTOWUV6pFv5MwLsHA7N2GfQLxmIe7k2211tKLHWPjNdfyY7nw=s2048.gif?t=1740688426\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procedurally generated platforming levels</strong>, a new adventure every time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge tough <strong>bosses</strong> at the end of each zone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect <strong>Pieces of Mind</strong> and spend them between levels to <strong>increase your stats</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/AGV_vUepI4vBKk8_M5oE5g6JMjI9TVw3eQLvsCCVxulQbK3VFWzX7ndRthOOPckOlzXqIzHOux3LbPkKLFozsETyyoMd2Iux5HVj7-657tYwzOm7uslm2t98Jd9cqjzPNj95ateEWlPKlQ=s2048.gif?t=1740688426\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock <strong>new weapons</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1763220/extras/AGV_vUfdMOmMo2uku0j-HjX1qrymei6cYZ9XxZha54FUmbztY6HQhb4FxYnQDrZ-9xw91ouNzemRjz7thnboKco-rxD7wOIWlJ_RJPsQ3NxeXv70uLNCATrz73nSxFxjXdC5f_0KELBdTQ=s2048.gif?t=1740688426\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1763